Four narrative source stills in `stills/shot-01.png` to `shot-04.png`, exact 1664×936 (16:9). Text-free `title-plate.png` and `end-plate.png` use the same visual world. Editor sets “The Paper Lantern” and “The End”, with matching typography, fades, transitions, sound and final encode.

